# Generated vLEI test chain (backend/scripts/make_test_chain.py).
# keystore/ holds the demo KERI private keys of every test party and must never be committed.
# The rest (wallets/, watcher/, root.json) is generated together with the keystore and only
# works with it: the demo agent signs with the keystore and the KELs are exported from it.
# Committing them without the keystore would leave a clone with credentials nobody can
# present, and regenerating rewrites them with new AIDs anyway. So the whole dir is ignored;
# run `python scripts/make_test_chain.py` after cloning.
backend/data/

